<title>USA: Empresas ICA sells interest in Mexpetrol.</title>
<headline>Empresas ICA sells interest in Mexpetrol.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Empresas ICA Controladora SA de CV said Friday that Mexpetrol SA de CV, one of its affiliate companies in Mexico, has sold a 67 percent interest in Mexpetrol Argentina SA, to Astra Cia Argentina de Petroleo SA and YPF Sociedad Anonima SA for $204 million.</p>
<p>Astra and YPF paid $102 million each.</p>
<p>ICA, which has an 18.25 percent participation in Mexpetrol SA, will receive about $37 million. ICA is Mexico's largest construction company.</p>
</text>
